{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108485","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108485/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108485/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108485/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108485","id":3219959138,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6_7K1i","number":108485,"title":"Build Project button not changing on theme change","user":{"login":"sakars","id":31991981,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxOTkxOTgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31991981?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakars","html_url":"https://github.com/sakars","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakars/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakars/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakars/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakars/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakars/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sakars/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-07-10T16:22:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T04:47:50Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.4.1 mono\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12500H (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe \"Build project\" button does not change fill color when light theme is turned on unlike the rest of the buttons.\n\n<img width=\"416\" height=\"45\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d4c9f7dd-ec32-436c-a5dd-c925d4ff34bf\" />\n\nIt's quite difficult to see, the icon is nearly invisible.\n\n<img width=\"404\" height=\"75\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bfcdf1dc-6ff4-4684-a367-f3857e0f6eca\" />\n\nUpon restarting Godot editor, the button changes mode back to expected.\n\n<img width=\"377\" height=\"30\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/839e6c2d-6203-4cf6-b93e-d9b094035c7b\" />\n\nIt seems that the same happens the other way around, but it's hard to tell what is expected behaviour in those cases.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open Godot editor in Default preset\n- Change interface/theme/preset in editor settings to Light or Solarized (Light)\n- The buttons in the panel will change color except the build project button\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[node_2d.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21167075/node_2d.zip)\n\nThe project is almost the default project, just a default C# file is attached to it to make the build project button pop up.\n\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108485/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108485/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}